# Lovdex Web UI — build/dev configuration
#
# NOTE: the browser app no longer reads VITE_* build-time env variables.
# Runtime values (isPlatform, CORS, ports) are fetched from GET /api/config
# at startup. Dev-server ports are static in vite.config.js:
#   dev  -> 5188   proxy backend -> 3188
# Set HOST if you need to bind the dev server to a specific interface.
#
# HOST=0.0.0.0
